# 🗄️ Database Systems

This folder contains my coursework for the **Database Systems** module.  
It demonstrates my understanding of relational database design, SQL querying, and database management principles.

---

## 📌 Module Overview

The aim of this module is to develop a solid foundation in database systems, including data modelling, normalisation, and the practical implementation of relational databases.

---

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- SQL
- MySQL
- Relational Database Design
- Entity–Relationship (ER) Modelling

---

## 🎯 Learning Outcomes

- Design relational databases using ER diagrams
- Apply normalisation principles to reduce data redundancy
- Create and manage tables using SQL
- Perform CRUD operations (Create, Read, Update, Delete)
- Write complex queries using joins, subqueries, and aggregation

